# This application currently requires NO environment variables.
#
# Nothing is read from process.env at runtime, and the only build-time
# reference is NODE_ENV, which Next.js sets itself. There is no API, no
# database, no auth, and no third-party key.
#
# Keep it that way until a feature genuinely needs one. When that happens:
#   - list the NAME here, never the value
#   - NEXT_PUBLIC_* is shipped to the browser and is not a secret
#   - real values go in the Cloudflare dashboard, or .dev.vars locally
